    "plain_text": "Martin Brook is a British leisure entrepreneur and property developer who co-founded Brook Leisure and chairs Quest Property. He entered the established wholesale business built by his father and grandfather, became its managing director and sold it. Working with his son Jason, he subsequently developed businesses in nightlife, housing and urban regeneration.",
