  "long_biography": {
    "plain_text": "A former department store in Barnsley became the starting point for Martin Brook’s nightclub business. He and his son refurbished it to open Hedonism, then sold the successful venue and built another Brook Leisure operation. Growth combined new developments with the acquisition of underperforming venues, reaching a substantial national estate.\n\nIn 1996, Brook joined Ivan Conroy to establish a housing business concentrating on smaller developments of family homes across Yorkshire. That partnership extended into the next generation: their sons Jason and Richard took the lead after a succession restructuring in 2010. The arrangement preserved a business founded around the two families’ complementary experience.",
